  "product": {
    "id": 7459943678206,
    "title": "SoundPEATS Air3 Air 3 Wireless Earphones QCC3040 Bluetooth V5.2 Earbuds AptX-Adaptive, 4 Mics+CVC Noise Cancellation, in-Ear Detection",
    "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><br></span></strong></p>\n<h1>SPECIFICATIONS</h1>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>With Microphone: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Yes</span></p>\n<p>Wireless Type: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">bluetooth</span></p>\n<p>Waterproof: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Yes</span></p>\n<p>Volume Control: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Yes</span></p>\n<p>Vocalism Principle: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Dynamic</span></p>\n<p>Support Memory Card: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">No</span></p>\n<p>Support APP: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">No</span></p>\n<p>Style: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">In-ear</span></p>\n<p>Sensitivity: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">115dB</span></p>\n<p>Resistance: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">32\u03a9</span></p>\n<p>Plug Type: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">L Bending</span></p>\n<p>Package List: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Charging case</span></p>\n<p>Package List: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Charging Cable</span></p>\n<p>Package List: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">User Manual</span></p>\n<p>Origin: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">CN(Origin)</span></p>\n<p>Number Of Drivers: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">2</span></p>\n<p>Model Number: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Air3</span></p>\n<p>Magnet Type: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">other</span></p>\n<p>Is wireless: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Yes</span></p>\n<p>Impedance Range: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">up to 32 \u2126</span></p>\n<p>Headphone Pads Material: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">other</span></p>\n<p>Function: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">for Video Game</span></p>\n<p>Function: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Sport</span></p>\n<p>Frequency Response Range: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">20 - 20000Hz</span></p>\n<p>Features: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">With Microphone</span></p>\n<p>Features: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">waterproof</span></p>\n<p>Driver Diameter: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">14.2mm</span></p>\n<p>Control Button: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">No</span></p>\n<p>Connectors: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Type c</span></p>\n<p>Communication: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">True Wireless</span></p>\n<p>Codecs: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">AAC</span></p>\n<p>Codecs: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Apt-X</span></p>\n<p>Codecs: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">sbc</span></p>\n<p>Charging Method: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">CABLE</span></p>\n<p>Certification: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">RoHS</span></p>\n<p>Certification: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">PSE</span></p>\n<p>Certification: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">CE</span></p>\n<p>Brand Name: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">SoundPEATS</span></p>\n<p>Bluetooth Version: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">5.1</span></p>\n<p>Active Noise-Cancellation: <span style=\"color: #333333;\">No</span></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>SoundPEATS Air3 Wireless Earphones QCC3040 Bluetooth V5.2 Earbuds AptX-Adaptive, 4 Mics+CVC Noise Cancellation, in-Ear Detection</strong></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>Ultra Small Size with Various Functions</strong></p>\n<p>In order to adapt to a compact lifestyle, SOUNDPEATS has been designed to be the smallest size of history, this new model is compact and easy to carry around. The cutting-edge technology is condensed into a small case, making it smaller than the traditional TrueAir 2, so even women with small ear holes, it is more convenient to carry without feeling bulky.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>Better Sound Than 0.6 inch (14.2 mm) Dynamic Driver</strong></p>\n<p>Based on the VGP 2021 EC Costs Award and Department Gold Awards, we have improved and tuned the 0.6 inch (14.2 mm) biocellose diaphragm. Rich 3D sound and natural listening experience, restoring realistic texture and detail. Enjoy the volume of the bass that you can expect from a large caliber and the open and natural sound field that is unique to the inner ear type.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>Supports aptX Adaptive Codec</strong></p>\n<p>With the latest improvement in sound skipping and sound loss in conventional aptX. Data transfer at a fixed bit rate, so there is a lot of sound interruptions and noise may occur depending on the environment where communication is crowded and time zones. AptX Adaptive allows you to create a stable audio listening environment with low latency by changing the transfer bit rate according to the signal status and the amount of data in your listening environment. Automatically adjusts to optimal sound quality and delay for stress-free enjoyment in various situations, such as music, videos, and games.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>Bluetooth 5.2</strong></p>\n<p>Adopts the latest Qualcomm SoC \"QCC3040\", which is compliant with Bluetooth 5.2. Supports device-specific connection system \"TrueWireless Mirroring\" and supports the next generation mainstream audio codec, aptX Adaptive. Not only is it very power-saving performance, it also automatically switches between parent-child devices as the environment changes and automatically adjusts the data transfer bit rate. Improved connection stability, connection range and battery life.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>In-Ear Detection Function</strong></p>\n<p>In-Ear Detection technology allows you to play or pause once the earbuds were put on or taken off, don't need to control the device or touch the earphone, very convenient</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">Note:</strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">Compared to other electronics, the earbuds are low power products. Hence for charging safety, please make sure the charging current is no greater than 5V 1A. Please do not use fast charger. Long term use an inappropriate adapter to charge will damage the case.</span></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>If the case and earbuds are damaged by using an improper adapter, this kind of man-made damage is not covered by the warranty.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">Specification:</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">1.Sensitivity: 115\u00b12dB</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">2.Resistance: 32\u03a9</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">3.Frequency Response Range: 20-20000Hz</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">4.Codecs: SBC, APTX, APTX-adaptive</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">5.Active Noise-Cancellation: No</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">6.Bluetooth Version: Bluetooth 5.2</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">7.Bluetooth Prole: HSP \u3001HFP \u3001 A2DP\u3001AVRCP</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">8.Bluetooth Chipset: Qualcomm QCC3040</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">9.Maximun Working Range: 33feet/10m(no abstacle)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">10.Play Time: About 5 hours (volume at 60%)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">11.Earbuds Charging Time: About 1.5 hours</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">12.Charging Case Charging Time: About 1.5 hours</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">13.Charging Case Recharge Earbuds: 2 times</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">14.Earbud Power Capacity: 3.7V/60mAh (30mAh*2)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">15.Charging Case Power Capacity: 3.7V/220mah</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">16.Earbud Dimension(L*W*H): \uff1a17.3*17.7*33.9mm</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); background-color: #ffffff;\">17.Charging Case Dimension(L*W*H):49.5*22.5*47.5mm</span></p>\n<p>\u00a0<img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/_4SIJ_7KtMrcX5wa15mR4uj1eDHxbKE77Wneo8XQ53GCl7W81Hks_j-mlArNk0hUKytpaDNWIPTgXFda1DO_ik5uiNA6D5Ny7Pfitvu1BJ-rlDG-e-8B3nWMthU8bnCbjTkhcPJdr4tN6utLu_Gsns7NQvgxDmBMojmzO_H6NMWlYjT4pArprQ2GLq_ql8-J5IR8XEK1TuGevVudAd5HyHKjGUurRFaDPSHlYuOT2eZLX7ES3ZPP64VsCDyrhM_py7Ss3m6j9ZTSPho9C-sYfotbEfs6L2S5mMQ3D4xegTpXSMFIfo_Gze3CsdZUD6UajMIoU6ll7vUUfbqBOvPfT6U-hfhaPypc1jhnSDP_Ak09DSorpfEAuhg9zkXQicWONnjlURCSGaGi2GA-PX56YxdBKch40FgNjCoOCGDWG2Rn_vA2bVnEPTXkQ9uRsZaHreSgaFB90U1Hy9zMyqyFD8VvbPcPHa21DHK9kTXGb8Vl1Vzim1BdisyfevxEW8ieRfQWjceR8qE9NfcE8Qggn8dKJD8kLs0Mn5pot4VeuLPU7JCz__alTBhbsdlrzZpZzAhd9ozWJ2gXsqQVo1B19Wj0vIq8FQxzdQSLYYU3G0GYteoyy3_kj6f7uiPhU2Tb62Vk4bDbp2-oEKEKOfEdCCSuvUl9zOKwe1fXnQLDNlYRTRAOQOmA0rWnn-HFux4kY2MrX3B6v_HdoEarkWkpdEQM=s929-no?authuser=1\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/_4SIJ_7KtMrcX5wa15mR4uj1eDHxbKE77Wneo8XQ53GCl7W81Hks_j-mlArNk0hUKytpaDNWIPTgXFda1DO_ik5uiNA6D5Ny7Pfitvu1BJ-rlDG-e-8B3nWMthU8bnCbjTkhcPJdr4tN6utLu_Gsns7NQvgxDmBMojmzO_H6NMWlYjT4pArprQ2GLq_ql8-J5IR8XEK1TuGevVudAd5HyHKjGUurRFaDPSHlYuOT2eZLX7ES3ZPP64VsCDyrhM_py7Ss3m6j9ZTSPho9C-sYfotbEfs6L2S5mMQ3D4xegTpXSMFIfo_Gze3CsdZUD6UajMIoU6ll7vUUfbqBOvPfT6U-hfhaPypc1jhnSDP_Ak09DSorpfEAuhg9zkXQicWONnjlURCSGaGi2GA-PX56YxdBKch40FgNjCoOCGDWG2Rn_vA2bVnEPTXkQ9uRsZaHreSgaFB90U1Hy9zMyqyFD8VvbPcPHa21DHK9kTXGb8Vl1Vzim1BdisyfevxEW8ieRfQWjceR8qE9NfcE8Qggn8dKJD8kLs0Mn5pot4VeuLPU7JCz__alTBhbsdlrzZpZzAhd9ozWJ2gXsqQVo1B19Wj0vIq8FQxzdQSLYYU3G0GYteoyy3_kj6f7uiPhU2Tb62Vk4bDbp2-oEKEKOfEdCCSuvUl9zOKwe1fXnQLDNlYRTRAOQOmA0rWnn-HFux4kY2MrX3B6v_HdoEarkWkpdEQM=s929-no?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d6kZp